Package: xios-desktop-theme
Name: Xios desktop theme
Version: 1.1.1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Maintainer: Max Leiter <maxwell.leiter@gmail.com>
Author: Max Leiter <maxwell.leiter@gmail.com>
Depends: xios-desktop-defaults, adwaita-icon-theme, hicolor-icon-theme, librsvg2-common
Section: X11
Priority: optional
Description: Adwaita cursors and wallpaper for the Xios desktop
 Gives the Xios desktop a complete look. Pulls in the Adwaita icon theme (via
 the adwaita-icon-theme package, the single owner of the icon/cursor data) so
 GTK and GNOME apps show real toolbar, menu, folder and file-type icons instead
 of empty squares, sets the matching Adwaita cursor theme as the system default
 at a touch-friendly size, and ships a default wallpaper. The icon theme, cursor
 theme and background are selected through a gsettings override and a default
 cursor-theme entry, so X11 and GTK clients both pick them up.
